1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,537
Recording & Troubleshooting.

2
00:00:02,487 --> 00:00:06,787
Record the service to USB and solve the most common problems.

3
00:00:06,787 --> 00:00:09,150
Recording to USB.

4
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:17,225
Plug a USB flash drive into the top panel: The X32 records stereo audio (what the congregation hears) directly to it.

5
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:23,287
Start recording from the screen: Navigate to the USB/Recorder section and press Record.

6
00:00:23,287 --> 00:00:27,612
Stop recording BEFORE removing the drive: Always stop first.

7
00:00:27,612 --> 00:00:31,337
Pulling the drive while recording corrupts the audio file.

8
00:00:31,337 --> 00:00:33,287
Power-Down Order.

9
00:00:33,287 --> 00:00:39,150
Mute mics, bring Main LR down: Start quieting things down before anything else powers off.

10
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:42,712
Speakers & amps off FIRST: Prevents the pop.

11
00:00:42,712 --> 00:00:45,975
Speakers off before anything else changes.

12
00:00:45,975 --> 00:00:51,275
Wireless off, batteries out or charging: Remove batteries and place on charger.

13
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:53,612
Ready for next Sunday.

14
00:00:53,612 --> 00:00:59,625
X32 and stage boxes off LAST: Console is always the last thing on and the last thing off.

15
00:00:59,625 --> 00:01:01,587
Quick Troubleshooting.

16
00:01:01,587 --> 00:01:04,825
Mic has no sound: Mic/pack on?

17
00:01:04,825 --> 00:01:06,737
MUTE light off?

18
00:01:06,737 --> 00:01:08,400
Fader up?

19
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,212
Meter moving?

20
00:01:10,212 --> 00:01:11,875
Right layer?

21
00:01:11,875 --> 00:01:16,700
Fader does nothing: Wrong layer active, or Sends on Fader is still lit.

22
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:18,425
Check both.

23
00:01:18,425 --> 00:01:22,337
Wireless cuts out: Check battery level on receiver.

24
00:01:22,337 --> 00:01:24,450
Replace the battery.

25
00:01:24,450 --> 00:01:27,737
Feedback squeal: Pull ringing mic's fader.

26
00:01:27,737 --> 00:01:30,237
Mute unused open mics.

27
00:01:30,237 --> 00:01:33,662
Monitor sounds wrong: Sends on Fader lit?

28
00:01:33,662 --> 00:01:35,800
Correct bus selected?

29
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:38,100
Make small adjustments.

30
00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:41,287
Livestream no audio: Tell the sound lead.

31
00:01:41,287 --> 00:01:44,100
Do NOT change routing during service.

32
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:49,412
Something very wrong: Recall Sunday scene only with sound lead OK, or call for help.

